d kappa sigma fraternity they had  headgear and all that but at the end of  the day when you're getting hit in the  head you're getting hit in the head  nathan's parents say he planned on going  to las vegas night clubs this weekend to  celebrate turning 21. instead they plan  on honoring him with a candlelight vigil  it's tough it's really tough this  because he's just he was a great guy  nathan's parents tell me he was a  registered organ donor and they were  told his organs will help at least eight  people  reporting in las vegas vanessa murphy  live local now
 

